  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Light system analysis and economic market systems analysis Turkana and Marsabit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This mapping of the Lake Turkana region aims to add additional expert(s) and their expertise to the inception phase of the embassy funded programme Sustainably Unlocking the Economic Potential of Lake Turkana.The additional expertise aims to provide a system analysis of the region from an economic perspective such as systemic economic challenges for the population around Lake Turkana to meet their needs in terms of economic development, to identify the strategic leverage points and prioritisation of interventions contributing to changes in the system and aiming for economic independency and more local entrepreneurship. Secondly, the mapping will provide a market analysis of the value chain of fish. As this value chain builds upon the boom and bust character of the lake, it has a huge impact on the economics and trade.</narrative>
  </description>
